<title>PAKISTAN: Port Conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds.</title>
<headline>Port Conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>KARACHI, Aug 5 - Vessels waiting off port, one general cargo, waiting for two days, one container, waiting for two days and one coaster waiting for three days. One vessel waiting off port for own reasons.</p>
